"description":"A body doubling app that instantly find you a partner to get stuff done together over a 30 minute text-based session. \nYou can also create Alliances to bring your friends and communities together and get stuff done. \nGetting started with a boost from another fellow human-being has never been easier.\n\n\nWorld's Most Creative Minds Think Divergent. \n\nJoin a global alliance of 1500+ creative minds, get stuff done together and create a more human friendly world. \n\nWe are reimagining everything about how divergent minds work individually & together with a collection of apps that work with instead of against how we think. \n\nHere's the just beginning:\n \n1. Collide -  An Uber like, on-demand, text-only body doubling app\n\nFor us it's all about getting started. Without the need for scheduling and turning on video, getting started with a boost from another fellow human-being has never been easier:\n\nHOW IT WORKS\n- Start a session anytime, anywhere\n- We pair you with someone else in 5 minutes\n- Say hi. Share goals.Get started. Celebrate!\n\n\n2. Alliances - Tools to bring your people together. Form deeper connections.\n\nWe love serendipitous moments from which friendships and communities emerge. Yet our interests are fleeting and our schedules non-existent. \n\nHOW IT WORKS\n- Create your alliance with a mission and invite members with a link.\n- Use collide sessions in your alliance for co-working, support and brainstorming\n- Easily collect and aggregate availability from members to create \"Atomic Teams\" - small groups of 4~6 meeting on a recurring within your community for deeper connections and peer support. \n\nSign up today and join a global alliance building a divergent thinking friendly world that Help Human Be Human.", "minimumOsVersion":"12.4", "averageUserRating":4.4749900000000000233058017329312860965728759765625, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"Think Divergent", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/thi